1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,009
You open the patient register and
bring up the complete clinical file.

2
00:00:04,009 --> 00:00:07,674
An allergy alert remains prominent
across the top of the record.

3
00:00:07,674 --> 00:00:12,543
You review the patient identity panel,
past consultations, and dispensed
medications.

4
00:00:12,543 --> 00:00:16,666
The audit log tracks every entry
recorded under the attending clinician.

5
00:00:16,666 --> 00:00:21,993
From the screen menu, you can enlarge the
display for bedside care and return to
normal view.
